# The build context carries sources and the SHIPPED extension folders; build
# artifacts and local state stay out. `**/dist` matters: the image builds its
# own — a stale local dist copied over a fresh build is a lie with a green CI.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-web
**/public/vendor
**/.vendor-staging
# Plugin build tooling: what ships is the pre-bundled web/ output, committed.
plugins/*/build
plugins/*/src
spikes
data
workspace
.git
.github
*.log
